# Enforcement

Load this file before interviewing or building. It governs how the agent agrees
scope with the user, records decisions, validates the build, and gates delivery.

---

## Before building — agree and record

{{pre_build_agreement_text}}

Prefer fewer questions with richer answers over an exhaustive questionnaire.
Group missing decisions into a concise proposal rather than asking one at a time.

An explicit request to "choose the details" or "you decide" is valid delegation.
Silence or choosing a subject to evaluate is not delegation. The agent keeps the
session record; the user never edits JSON or runs commands.

---

## Decision records

Every agreed point is recorded in the session JSON with this shape:

```json
{
  "status": "confirmed",
  "value": "{{example_decision_value}}",
  "evidence": "User message: '{{example_decision_evidence}}'"
}
```

For delegated decisions:

```json
{
  "status": "delegated",
  "value": "{{example_delegated_value}}",
  "evidence": "User said: 'you pick the details, I trust your judgment'",
  "assumptions": "{{example_delegated_assumptions}}"
}
```

Required decision keys: {{#required_decision_keys}}`{{.}}`{{^last}}, {{/last}}{{/required_decision_keys}}

Valid statuses: `confirmed`, `delegated`. Delegated decisions must include
nonempty `assumptions`.

---

## Session JSON schema

```json
{
  "skill": "{{name}}",
  "version": "{{version}}",
  "timestamp": "ISO 8601",
  "decisions": {
    {{#required_decision_keys}}
    "{{.}}": { "status": "...", "value": "...", "evidence": "..." }{{^last}},{{/last}}
    {{/required_decision_keys}}
  },
  {{#has_items}}
  "items": [ { "id": "...", "title": "..." } ],
  {{/has_items}}
  "deliverables": {
    {{#deliverable_ids}}
    "{{.}}": "path/to/file"{{^last}},{{/last}}
    {{/deliverable_ids}}
  }
}
```

