## Delivery gate

The session is complete when all of the following are true:

{{#delivery_criteria}}
- {{.}}
{{/delivery_criteria}}

The delivery gate runs `scripts/verify_delivery.py` which checks:
1. All verification scripts pass
2. Session decisions are recorded and valid
3. All deliverables exist and are non-empty
4. Provenance citations are present
